# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020003> (municipal heat plan)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020003> "A municipal heat plan is a plan specification that contains a heating plan in accordance with §23 of the German Heating Planning Act (WPG). It includes a cartographic representation of the current status and potential analysis, the division into heat supply zones, the indicators of the target scenario, the presentation of heat supply types for the target year, and measures of the implementation strategy. The textual and graphical explanations of the suitability assessment, the current status analysis, the target scenario, and the implementation strategy may be attached to the heat plan as external references."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020003> "KWP"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020003> "Kommunale Wärmeplanung"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020003> "WP_Plan"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020003> "municipal heat plan"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020003> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/9
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/13")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020003> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000974>)
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020003> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020005>))
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020003> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020006>))
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020003> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020007>))
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020003> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020008>))
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020003> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030001>))

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020005> (aggregated inventory analysis)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020005> "An aggregated inventory analysis is a descriptive information content entity that contains an aggregation of the existing conditions analysis for a certain heat planning area, in accordance with WPG §15.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020005> "Bestandsanalyse"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020005> "WP_Bestandsanalyse_aggregiert"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020005> "According to the WPG Annex 2 I, the aggregated inventory analysis contains information about
1. the current annual final energy consumption of heat by energy source and final energy sector in kilowatt-hours, and the resulting greenhouse gas emissions in tons of carbon dioxide equivalent,
2. the current share of renewable energy and unavoidable waste heat in the annual final energy consumption of heat by energy source, expressed as a percentage,
3. the current annual final energy consumption of district heating by energy source in kilowatt-hours,
4. the current share of renewable energy and unavoidable waste heat in the annual final energy consumption of district heating by energy source, expressed as a percentage,
5. the current number of decentralized heat generators, including building transfer stations, by type of heat generator, including the energy source used.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020005> "aggregated inventory analysis"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020005> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/9
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/13")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020005> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000853>)

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020006> (aggregated potential analysis)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020006> "An aggregated potential analysis is a descriptive information content entity that contains an summary of the analysis of the potentials for a certain heat planning area, in accordance with WPG Annex 2 II.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020006> "Potenzialanalyse"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020006> "WP_Potenzialanalyse_aggregiert"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020006> "In accordance with WPG §16, the planning authority determines the potentials for:
- heat generation from renewable energy sources
- utilization of unavoidable waste heat
- utilization of central heat storage systems
- energy savings through the reduction of heat demand in buildings, as well as in industrial and commercial processes.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020006> "aggregated potential analysis"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020006> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/9
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/13")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020006> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000853>)

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020007> (target scenario)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020007> "The target scenario is an objective specification that uses indicators to describe how the goal of a heat supply based on renewable energy or the use of unavoidable waste heat is to be achieved. Unless otherwise specified, the indicators must be provided for the planned area as a whole and for the years 2030, 2035, 2040, and 2045, respectively. In accordance with WPG Annex 2 III.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020007> "WP_Zielszenarioindikatoren"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020007> "Zielszenario"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020007> "The indicators are defined in WPG Annex 2 III and are:
1. the annual final energy consumption of the entire heat supply in kilowatt-hours per year, differentiated by final energy sectors and energy carriers.
2. the annual greenhouse gas emissions, within the meaning of Section 2 No. 1 of the Federal Climate Change Act, of the entire heat supply of the planned area, in tonnes of carbon dioxide equivalent
3. the annual final energy consumption of district heating or other grid-based heat supply by energy carrier in kilowatt-hours per year, and the share of the energy carriers in the total final energy consumption of the grid-based heat supply in percent
4. the share of grid-based heat supply in the total final energy consumption of the heat supply in percent.
5. the number of buildings connected to a heating network and their share of the total number of buildings in the planned area in percent.
6. the annual final energy consumption from gas networks by energy carrier in kilowatt-hours per year, and the share of the energy carriers in the total final energy consumption of gaseous energy carriers in percent.
7. the number of buildings connected to a gas network and their share of the total number of buildings in the planned area in percent.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020007> "target scenario"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020007> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000476>)

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020008> (implementation measure)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020008> "An implementation measure is an action specification that specifies the measures to be taken according to the implementation strategy of a municipal heat plan.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020008> "Maßnahme"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020008> "WP_Maßnahme"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020008> "implementation measure"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020008> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/9
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/13")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020008> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000965>)

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020009> (role of region in municipal heat plan)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020009> "A role of a region in a municipal heat plan is a role that can be assigned to a region of relevance in a municipal heat plan.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020009> "role of region in municipal heat plan"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020009> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000023>)

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020010> (municipality area role)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020010> "A role of a two-dimensional spatial region that covers the area of a municipality.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020010> "municipality area role"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020010> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020010> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020009>)
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020010> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000052> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020017>))

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020011> (heat plan area role)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020011> "A role of a region of relevance within a municipality for which a municipal heat plan is created, see WPG §3.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020011> "heat plan area role"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020011> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020011> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020009>)
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020011> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000052> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020018>))

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020012> (unallocated heat supply subarea role)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020012> "A role of a subarea of a heat supply area that is unallocated for heat supply.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020012> "unallocated heat supply subarea role"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020012> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020012> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020009>)
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020012> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000052> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020020>))
DisjointClasses(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020012> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020013>)

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020013> (heat plan subarea role)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020013> "A role of a subarea of a heat supply area that  is designated for heat supply.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020013> "heat plan subarea role"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020013> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020013> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020009>)
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020013> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000052> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020019>))

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020014> (excluded area role)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020014> "An exclusion area role is a role of a spatially delimited area within the planned area that is identified in the potential analysis because the use of certain heat supply potentials is excluded or significantly restricted due to legal, environmental, technical, or other site-specific constraints.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020014> "Annex 2, Part II of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020014> "excluded area role"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020014> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020014> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020009>)

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020016> (energy saving area role)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020016> "An energy saving area role is a role of a planned heat plan subarea that is borne when the subarea has increased energy saving potential due to its energy- or climate-related suitability as a redevelopment area under the German Building Act or due to a high share of buildings with high specific final energy consumption for space heating.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020016> "Section 136(2) of the German Building Act (BauGB)
Section 18(5)  of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020016> "energy saving area role"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020016> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020016> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020009>)

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020017> (municipality area)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020017> "A municipality area is a region of relevance that encompasses the exact territory of a municipality.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020017> "Gemeindegebiet"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020017> "municipality area"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020017> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020017> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360020>)
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020017> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000053> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020010>))

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020018> (heat plan area)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020018> "A heat plan area is a subarea of a municipality for which a municipal heat plan is created. It consists of several heat supply subregions.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020018> "Beplantes Gebiet")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020018> "WP_Waermversorgungsgebiet")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020018> "Wärmeversorgungsgebiet")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020018> "Section 3(1) no. 2  of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020018> "heat plan area"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020018> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020018> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360020>)
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020018> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020017>))
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020018> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000053> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020011>))

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020019> (heat plan subarea)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020019> "A heat plan subarea is a region of relevance that consists of several parcels of land or parts thereof, comprising individual or multiple building blocks. It is part of a heat supply area of a municipality and is grouped together by the planning authority for the purpose of assessing potential heat supply options and for the corresponding division into projected heat supply areas.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020019> "WP_BeplantesTeilgebiet")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020019> "beplantes Teilgebiet")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020019> "heat plan subarea"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020019> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
AnnotationAssertion(<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020019> "Section 3(1) no. 3  of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020019> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360020>)
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020019> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020018>))
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020019> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000053> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020013>))

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020020> (unallocated heat supply subarea)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020020> "An unallocated heat supply subarea is a region of relevance that is part of a municipality area and that is not designated as a prospective heat supply area in the municipal heat plan.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020020> "WP_NichtBeplantesTeilgebiet")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020020> "nicht beplantes Teilgebiet")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020020> "unallocated heat supply subarea"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020020> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020020> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00360020>)
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020020> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020017>))
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020020> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000053> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020012>))

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020021> (area for decentralized heat suply)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020021> "An area for decentralized heat suply is a heat plan subarea that is not primarily indented to be supplied by a district heating or natural gas network.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020021> "Gebiet für dezentrale Wärmeversorgung")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020021> "Section 3(1) no. 6 WPG  of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020021> "area for decentralized heat suply"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020021> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020021> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020019>)
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020021> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020018>))
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020021> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000053> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020022>))

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020022> (role of area for decentralized heat suply)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020022> "A role of an area for decentralized heat suply is a heat plan subarea that is not primarily indented to be supplied by a district heating or natural gas network, see WPG §3 part 6.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020022> "role of area for decentralized heat suply"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020022> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020022> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020009>)
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020022> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000052> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020019>))

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030001> (implementation strategy)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030001> "An implementation strategy is a descriptive information content entity that describes the implementation measures to be realized in order to achieve the objective of supplying heat generated exclusively from renewable energy sources or unavoidable waste heat by the target year.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030001> "Umsetzungsstrategie"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030001> "According to WPG Annex 2 VI, the implementation strategy shall be described in textual form. In particular, the implementation measures shall specify:

1. which steps are required for the implementation of a measure.
2. by which point in time the implementation of the measure is intended to be completed.
3. which costs are associated with the planning and implementation of the measure,
4. who bears the costs referred to in No. 3.
5. which positive effects of the measures on achieving the target scenario and the objectives of this Act are expected, and
6. in the case of an area with more than 45,000 inhabitants, which financing mechanisms for implementing the strategies and measures for transitioning consumers to renewable energies were identified and how they were weighted.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030001> "implementation strategy"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030001> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/9
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/13")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030001> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000974>)

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030005> (hydrogen grid area)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030005> "An hydrogen network area is heat plan subarea in which a hydrogen network exists or is planned, and a significant proportion of the local end users are to be supplied via the hydrogen network for the purpose of heat generation.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030005> "Wasserstoffnetzgebiet"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030005> "Section 3(1) no. 23  of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030005> "hydrogen grid area"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030005> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030005> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020019>)
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030005> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020018>))
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030005> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000053> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030006>))

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030006> (hydrogen grid area role)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030006> "A role that inheres in a heat plan subarea and indicates that the subarea is designated for heat supply through a hydrogen network, where a hydrogen network exists or is planned and a significant proportion of end users are intended to be supplied with hydrogen-based heat generation."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030006> "Section 3(23) of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030006> "hydrogen grid area role"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030006> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030006> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020009>)

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030007> (district heating area)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030007> "A district heating area is a heat plan subarea in which a district heating network exists or is planned, and a significant proportion of the local end users are to be supplied via the district heating network.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030007> "Wärmenetzgebiet"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030007> "Section 3(1) no. 18  of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030007> "district heating area"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030007> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030007> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020019>)
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030007> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000053> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030008>))

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030008> (district heating area role)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030008> "A role that inheres in a heat plan subarea and indicates that the subarea is designated for heat supply through a district heating network, where a district heating network exists or is planned and a significant proportion of local end users are intended to be supplied via that network.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030008> "Section 3(1) no. 18  of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030008> "district heating area role"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030008> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030008> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020009>)

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030009> (heat network densification area)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030009> "An heat network densification area is a district heating area in which end users located in the immediate vicinity of an existing heat network are to be connected to it without requiring the expansion of the heat network")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030009> "Wärmenetzverdichtungsgebiet"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030009> "Section 3(1) no. 18  of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030009> "heat network densification area"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030009> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030009> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030007>)

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030010> (heat network expansion area)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030010> "An heat network expansion area is an district heating area where no heat network currently exists and which are to be connected to an existing heat network for the first time through the construction of new heat pipelines.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030010> "Wärmenetzausbaugebiet"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030010> "Section 3(1) no. 18  of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030010> "heat network expansion area"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030010> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030010> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030007>)

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030011> (heat network development area)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030011> "An heat network development area is a district heating area that is to be connected to a new heating network.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030011> "Wärmenetzneubaugebiet"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030011> "Section 3(1) no. 18  of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030011> "“new heating network” means a heating network, 

a) 
construction of which begins after December 31, 2023, 

b) 
which, for the first time after January 1, 2024, exceeds the size of a building network

c) 
construction of which for the purpose of network expansion begins after December 31, 2023, and which is not connected, or is connected only to a minor extent, to an existing upstream network—either directly via a hydraulic connection or indirectly via heat transfer; a minor extent is deemed to exist if the annual average share of heat supplied from the existing network is less than 20 percent,")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030011> "heat network development area"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030011> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030011> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030007>)

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030012> (energy saving area)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030012> "An energy saving area is a planned heat plan subarea with increased energy saving potential, identified either by its energy- or climate-related suitability as a redevelopment area under the German Building Act or by a high share of buildings with high specific final energy consumption for space heating.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030012> "Energieeinspargebiet"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030012> "Section 136(2) of the German Building Act (BauGB)
Section 18(5)  of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030012> "energy saving area"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030012> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030012> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020019>)

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030013> (area under suitability assessment)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030013> "A review area is a planned heat plan subarea that is not assigned to a hydrogen network area, district heating area, or an area for decentralized heat supply because the conditions required for such an assignment are not yet sufficiently known, or because a significant share of the local end users is expected to be supplied with heat in another way, such as through grid-bound green methane supplied via an existing or planned gas distribution network. In this case, the gas distribution network operator must provide the planning authority with all relevant planning documents and evidence needed to assess the suitability of the area for green methane supply, including documents showing consistency with upstream gas network planning or evidence that sufficient green methane can be produced and stored for the target year.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030013> "Prüfgebiet"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030013> "Section 3(1) no. 10 and Section 28 of the German Heat Planning Act (WPG)")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030013> "area under suitability assessment"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00020426> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030013> "issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/issues/12
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/municipal-heat-planning-ontology/pull/15")
SubClassOf(<https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030013> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00020019>)

# Class: <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030014> (area under suitability assessment role)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purl.org/mhpo/ontology/MHPO_00030014> "A review area role is a role that inheres in a planned heat plan subarea when, within municipal heat planning, the subarea is not assigned to a hydrogen network area, district heating area, or decentralized heat supply area because the conditions required for such an assignment are not yet sufficiently known, or because a significant share of the local end users is expected to be supplied with heat in another way, such as through grid-bound green methane supplied via an existing or planned gas distribution network.")
